<translate>
==== EquippedNoSprint ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is set to true, then the player will not be able to run fast when this item is equipped.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
EquippedNoSprint = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

